      ":question/math-academy-id": "q-39533",
      ":question/problem": "Let $f(x) = a\\sqrt{x + b} + c$. Now consider the following properties of $f(x)$:\n\n- The domain of $f(x)$ is $x \u2208 [1, \u221e)$.\n- The range is $f(x) \u2208 [2, \u221e)$.\n- The point $(5, 4)$ lies on the graph of $y = f(x)$.\n\nFind the value of $a + b + c$."
